{"id":373,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"地域と世界をつなぐ佐野附属中の学び","feature_description":"栃木県立佐野高等学校附属中学校は、Sanoグローカル構想のもとで、学びを地域と世界の両方に開く公立の附属中学校です。中高一貫の学びに加えて、部活動も中学校段階から整い、基礎学力と活動の両立を図りやすい構成です。公立校として地域に根ざしつつ、広い視野を育てる点が特徴です。探究的な学びにもつながります。学びの幅も広がります。","clubs":[{"id":6847,"name":"陸上競技部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6848,"name":"野球部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6849,"name":"ラグビー部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6850,"name":"女子テニス部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6851,"name":"男子卓球部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6852,"name":"男子バスケットボール部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6853,"name":"女子バレーボール部（中）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6854,"name":"囲碁将棋部（中）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6855,"name":"吹奏楽部（中）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6856,"name":"美術部（中）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-edu.ed.jp/sano/nc3/5658acba6638f75b908f34f3af0a7b01","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6857,"name":"手芸部（中）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tochigi-ed